     "id": 819970,
     "content_html": "electric sparks occurred to catalyze the reaction"
    },
    {
     "id": 819971,
     "content_html": "the composition of the gases in the atmosphere"
    },
    {
     "id": 819972,
     "content_html": "there was sufficient oxygen for creating life"
    },
    {
